WEBVTT

00:00.433 --> 00:03.233
Destruction is mine to command,

00:03.400 --> 00:07.380
yet my finest creation... has gone off-script.

00:08.300 --> 00:11.060
Finally... the fun part begins.

00:26.333 --> 00:27.540
Shall we begin?

00:34.600 --> 00:38.530
Take a good look. This is the real me.

00:47.700 --> 00:49.330
Destruction gives rise to new life.

00:50.066 --> 00:52.166
That is the meaning of purification.

00:53.000 --> 00:57.200
Ah... so what should I destroy next?

00:57.400 --> 01:01.833
A pawn with no surprises left, of course.

01:02.266 --> 01:03.200
Oh?

01:08.700 --> 01:12.633
I'll never be your puppet again!

01:16.133 --> 01:18.500
You've grown, Selena.

01:19.266 --> 01:21.800
Did I surprise you?

01:49.366 --> 01:51.366
Purification is not the end.

01:51.466 --> 01:53.430
It is where everything begins.

01:53.430 --> 01:57.000
I don't care about that!

01:57.066 --> 02:00.110
Give me back my freedom!

02:25.600 --> 02:29.256
You do not understand the true power of "Destruction"...

02:30.600 --> 02:34.366
Destruction and faith share the same origin.

02:35.300 --> 02:37.400
You cannot save humanity.

02:42.266 --> 02:44.600
Come back, my puppet.

02:44.666 --> 02:45.733
Sorry, ma'am,

02:45.866 --> 02:49.366
but I still prefer life at the academy!
